#: ../../linux/Unix-commands/kill.rst:2
msgid "kill"
msgstr "kill"

#: ../../linux/Unix-commands/kill.rst:4
msgid "kill [-signal] pid 默认signal为TERM -l 列出所有signal -TERM会被捕获，-KILL可以保证进程被杀死 killall 以名字方式来杀死进程"
msgstr "kill [-signal] pid, the default signal is TERM -l lists all signals -TERM can be caught, -KILL guarantees the process is killed killall kills processes by name"

